  "c643a1b2-0945-4a2e-9b10-adfca147eea9"],
 " acts only under the user's own alias; entries of other aliases cannot be \
deleted."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->693,ExpressionUUID->"a81b3cd5-1ad8-4aca-a964-d41dc903ebf9"],

Cell["\<\
DeleteData[name] removes the entry directory and everything in it, including \
the notebook. There is no confirmation and no undo.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->694,ExpressionUUID->"ee253552-a590-4f7d-8ccc-88ac85a1aa65"],

Cell["\<\
It issues DeleteData::missingname if the entry is not found under the current \
$Alias.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->695,ExpressionUUID->"2cd32a3c-22fb-4f3f-82e8-2c0cb27bfd10"],

Cell["\<\
SaveData calls DeleteData internally when overwriting an existing entry.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->696,ExpressionUUID->"b24ea143-a65d-4d4b-9321-18cb32358341"]
}, Open  ]],

